an> <span style=\"opacity: .5;\">My Links<\/span><span style=\"opacity: .5;\">My Team<\/span><span style=\"opacity: .5;\">Account<\/span><\/div><p style=\"margin: 0 0 .6em; font-size: .85em; color: #555;\">Your business at a glance<\/p><div style=\"display: flex; gap: 1.4em; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><div style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 800; color: #4b4fbd;\">$490<\/div><div style=\"font-size: .75em; color: #777;\">Unpaid balance<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 800; color: #4b4fbd;\">$1,960<\/div><div style=\"font-size: .75em; color: #777;\">Paid to date<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 800; color: #4b4fbd;\">1<\/div><div style=\"font-size: .75em; color: #777;\">Active link<\/div><\/div><div><div style=\"font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 800; color: #4b4fbd;\">2<\/div><div style=\"font-size: .75em; color: #777;\">Team<\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin-top: 1.1em; padding-top: 1em; border-top: 1px solid #eee;\"><div style=\"font-size: .8em; color: #555; margin-bottom: .4em;\">Your link<\/div><div style=\"background: #F0EFFB; border-radius: 6px; padding: .5em .7em; font-size: .75em; color: #4b4fbd; font-family: monospace;\">solar.gemzonline.com\/go\/...<\/div><\/div><\/div><p style=\"text-align: center; color: #fff; opacity: .75; font-size: .8em; margin-top: .8em;\">Your actual affiliate dashboard \u2014 real numbers, real link, live the moment you sign up.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div>","align":"center","_element_width":"inherit"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"who4th1s","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<div style=\"padding:2.8em 1.5em;background:#F7F9FC;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1.8em;font-weight:800;color:#181A21;margin:0 0 .3em;\">Built For People Who Already Know Homeowners And Businesses Ready For Solar<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#555;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 2em;\">If you have a network &mdash; personal, professional, or a customer list &mdash; you're probably already sitting on solar referrals without realizing it.<\/p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7em;justify-content:center;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:24px;padding:.6em 1.2em;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;color:#2E5FA3;\">Roofers & Home Improvement Contractors<\/div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:24px;padding:.6em 1.2em;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;color:#2E5FA3;\">Realtors<\/div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:24px;padding:.6em 1.2em;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;color:#2E5FA3;\">Electricians & HVAC Pros<\/div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:24px;padding:.6em 1.2em;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;color:#2E5FA3;\">Insurance Agents<\/div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:24px;padding:.6em 1.2em;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;color:#2E5FA3;\">Property Managers & Commercial Landlords<\/div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:24px;padding:.6em 1.2em;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;color:#2E5FA3;\">Past Solar Customers<\/div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:24px;padding:.6em 1.2em;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;color:#2E5FA3;\">Community Connectors<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","align":"center","_element_width":"inherit"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"why50lar","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<div style=\"padding: 2.8em 1.5em;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.8em; font-weight: 800; color: #181a21; margin: 0 0 .3em;\">Why Solar Gemz<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #555; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2em;\">Not another \"solar is good for the planet\" pitch \u2014 here's what's actually different about earning through this platform.<\/p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5em; justify-content: center;\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 260px; max-width: 320px; background: #EEF4FB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.6em;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; margin-bottom: .4em;\">\ud83d\udcb5<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 .4em; font-size: 1.15em; color: #181a21;\">Commissions start at $200+<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #444; font-size: .95em;\">Real dollars per completed referral, not points or gift cards. Paid by PayPal, ACH or Wise\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 260px; max-width: 320px; background: #EEF4FB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.6em;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; margin-bottom: .4em;\">\u2705<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 .4em; font-size: 1.15em; color: #181a21;\">Vetted installers only<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #444; font-size: .95em;\">Every partner is a real, approved local installer, not a random lead-gen middleman. Your referral gets handled by someone who'll actually show up.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 260px; max-width: 320px; background: #EEF4FB; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.6em;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; margin-bottom: .4em;\">\ud83d\udcc8<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 .4em; font-size: 1.15em; color: #181a21;\">It compounds<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; color: #444; font-size: .95em;\">Recruit other affiliates and earn a cut of their referrals too, three tiers deep. Most referral programs stop at \"refer one person, get one reward.\"<\/p>\n<a href=\"\/build-a-team\/\" style=\"display:inline-block;margin-top:.8em;background:#3F8353;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:.85em;padding:.5em 1.1em;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;\">See How Team-Building Works &rarr;<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","align":"center","_element_width":"inherit"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"u2wehndl","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<div style=\"padding:2.8em 1.5em;background:#F7F9FC;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1.8em;font-weight:800;color:#181A21;margin:0 0 .3em;\">You're Not Becoming A Solar Company. You're Making An Introduction.<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#555;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 2em;\">The split is simple: you make the connection, everything after that is on us and the installer.<\/p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5em;justify-content:center;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 320px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #2E5FA3;border-radius:12px;padding:1.6em;\">\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .8em;font-size:1.1em;color:#2E5FA3;\">You handle<\/h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:1.2em;color:#444;font-size:.95em;line-height:1.9;\">\n<li>Making the introduction<\/li>\n<li>Sharing your link<\/li>\n<li>Staying focused on what you're already good at<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 320px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:12px;padding:1.6em;\">\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .8em;font-size:1.1em;color:#181A21;\">We handle<\/h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:1.2em;color:#444;font-size:.95em;line-height:1.9;\">\n<li>Vetting the installer<\/li>\n<li>Permits, HOA approval, and utility interconnection<\/li>\n<li>The install, inspections, and follow-up support<\/li>\n<li>Tracking your referral and paying you automatically<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","align":"center","_element_width":"inherit"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"8314240","elType":"widget","settings":{"paragraph":{"$$type":"html-v3","value":{"content":null,"children":[]}}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"e-paragraph","styles":[],"interactions":[],"editor_settings":[],"version":"0.0"},{"id":"referbtn1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:1.5em;\">\n<a href=\"\/refer-a-friend\/\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2E5FA3;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:.85em 2em;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-size:1.1em;\">Refer Now &amp; Earn Rewards<\/a>\n<\/div>","align":"center","_element_width":"inherit"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"pr0cyc1e","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<div style=\"padding:2.8em 1.5em;\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1.8em;font-weight:800;color:#181A21;margin:0 0 .3em;\">How A Referral Actually Moves Through The System<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#555;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 2em;\">Same 6 steps, every single referral &mdash; usually 3 to 4 months from first referral to final payout, since permits and utility interconnection take real time.<\/p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.2em;justify-content:center;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 220px;max-width:280px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:12px;padding:1.4em;\">\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E5FA3;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.7em;\">1<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .4em;font-size:1.05em;color:#181A21;\">Share your link<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#444;font-size:.9em;\">Text it, email it, or post it. Every click is tracked automatically the moment they land on it.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 220px;max-width:280px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:12px;padding:1.4em;\">\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E5FA3;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.7em;\">2<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .4em;font-size:1.05em;color:#181A21;\">They request a quote<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#444;font-size:.9em;\">Takes two minutes, no commitment, no pressure. We ask for their state so we can match them to the right installer.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 220px;max-width:280px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:12px;padding:1.4em;\">\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E5FA3;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.7em;\">3<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .4em;font-size:1.05em;color:#181A21;\">We match them to a partner<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#444;font-size:.9em;\">A vetted, approved local installer who actually covers their area, not a random name off a list.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 220px;max-width:280px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:12px;padding:1.4em;\">\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E5FA3;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.7em;\">4<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .4em;font-size:1.05em;color:#181A21;\">Installer handles the details<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#444;font-size:.9em;\">Site assessment, permits, HOA approval, and the utility interconnection paperwork, all handled for them.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 220px;max-width:280px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:12px;padding:1.4em;\">\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E5FA3;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.7em;\">5<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .4em;font-size:1.05em;color:#181A21;\">Installation completes<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#444;font-size:.9em;\">Final inspection and utility connection approved, plus ongoing support once the system is live, not just a one-and-done install.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 220px;max-width:280px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #CBDCEF;border-radius:12px;padding:1.4em;\">\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#2E5FA3;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.7em;\">6<\/div>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .4em;font-size:1.05em;color:#181A21;\">You get paid<\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#444;font-size:.9em;\">Commission clears once the sale is recorded &mdash; no cap on how many people you refer.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:1.6em;color:#2E5FA3;font-weight:700;\">&#8635; Then it starts again with your next referral<\/p>\n<\/div>","align":"center","_element_width":"inherit"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]